# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repository holds the EHR application only: backend and staff frontend.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Separate products with their own repositories.
Awibi-EHR-Landing-main/
Awibi-Identity-Backend/
Awibi-Identity-Frontend/

# Research and working material — contains credential files, a database backup
# and 279 images including patient-facing screens. A private repository is not
# a safe home for any of that.
Ground Research Resource/
research-audit/

# Awibi Scout source material. ~100 MB, and it includes clinical textbook PDFs
# that are not ours to redistribute. The app ships the derived data instead —
# see Awibi-EHR-Backend/src/data/scout/, rebuilt by scripts/build-scout-data.js.
AWIBI SCOUT/
# Tooling that processes that research material belongs with it, not with the app.
# Anchored with a leading slash: a bare "scripts/" matches at ANY depth, which
# silently swallowed Awibi-EHR-Backend/scripts/ — new backend scripts would be
# committed-and-missing with nothing to indicate why.
/scripts/

# Local working notes and audit write-ups.
*.md
!README.md
!Awibi-EHR-Backend/**/*.md
!Awibi-EHR-Frontend/**/*.md
README.html
*.ps1

# Local tool settings.
.claude/

# Disabled nested repositories, kept on disk so their history is recoverable.
**/.git.disabled-*/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets — never commit
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# Generated production secrets. Plaintext on disk — never committed.
*.local.txt
PRODUCTION_SECRETS*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Database exports
*.sql
*.dump
*.backup
*.backup.gz

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dependencies, build output, runtime
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.vite/
**/coverage/
**/.cache/
**/generated/
**/uploads/
**/logs/
*.log
*.pid

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
